  <data name="lblChem.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>BULi (BiyU Learner's Information) is a specialized Student Information System 
designed exclusively for the Bicol University College of Science students and 
faculty. It provides a secure, centralized platform for managing academic 
records and institutional user roles. Developed using C# Windows Forms and 
MySQL, the system ensures efficient, real-time data handling for students and 
faculty. The application delivers a streamlined digital experience tailored 
directly to the department's workflow. It ultimately bridges administrative 
requirements and everyday usability into a unified desktop environment.</value>
  </data>
